{"seq":1,"slug":"release-train-cadence","title":"发布火车与节奏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/release-process/release-train-cadence","wordCount":1582,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"发布火车与节奏\">发布火车与节奏</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>发布火车（Release Train）是时间驱动的发布模型——按固定时刻表发车，准备好的功能搭车，未准备好的等下一班。火车不为任何功能延迟发车。这种模型将发布变为可预测的节奏事件，消除范围蔓延压力，使自动化投资回报最大化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"火车隐喻的工程含义\">火车隐喻的工程含义</h2><p>发布火车（Release Train）借用铁路运输的隐喻：火车按固定时刻表发车，准备好的功能搭上这班车，未准备好的等下一班。<strong>火车不会为任何一个功能延迟发车</strong>——这是该模型的核心纪律。</p>\n<p>这种&quot;时间驱动&quot;的发布模型与&quot;功能驱动&quot;的发布模型形成对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>时间驱动（火车模型）</th>\n<th>功能驱动</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>发布时间</td>\n<td>固定节奏，不可变</td>\n<td>功能完成时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范围</td>\n<td>可变——截止时准备好什么就发什么</td>\n<td>固定——指定功能全部完成才发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可预测性</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压力分布</td>\n<td>均匀</td>\n<td>集中在发布前</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风险</td>\n<td>低（每次变更量可控）</td>\n<td>高（大批量变更一次上线）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>火车模型的心理学效应同样重要：当开发者知道&quot;下班车两周后就来&quot;时，他们不会为了赶上这班车而仓促提交质量低下的代码——错过这班没关系，下一班很快。</p>\n<h2 id=\"节奏设计的维度\">节奏设计的维度</h2><p>选择发布节奏需要在以下维度间取得平衡：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>最优节奏</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>测试周期</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>合规审批时间</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>消费者吸收能力</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>团队规模</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{最优节奏} = f(\\text{测试周期}, \\text{合规审批时间}, \\text{消费者吸收能力}, \\text{团队规模})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">最优节奏</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">测试周期</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">合规审批时间</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">消费者吸收能力</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">团队规模</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>节奏</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n<th>风险特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>持续（按提交）</td>\n<td>SaaS、内部工具</td>\n<td>GitHub.com</td>\n<td>每次变更极小，回滚简单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日级</td>\n<td>快速迭代的 Web 应用</td>\n<td>Shopify</td>\n<td>需要强大的自动化和特性开关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周级</td>\n<td>中等规模团队</td>\n<td>GitLab（月度+patch）</td>\n<td>平衡速度与稳定性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双周</td>\n<td>多团队协作</td>\n<td>SAFe ART 默认迭代</td>\n<td>足够的集成测试时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>月级</td>\n<td>企业软件、移动应用</td>\n<td>Firefox、Chrome</td>\n<td>应用商店审核周期适配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>季级</td>\n<td>合规密集型行业</td>\n<td>银行核心系统</td>\n<td>变更量大，需要长回归测试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"chrome-firefox-的四周节奏\">Chrome/Firefox 的四周节奏</h3><p>Chrome 和 Firefox 都采用约四周的发布节奏，配合多通道（Canary → Dev → Beta → Stable）的渐进式稳定。以 Chrome 为例：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"gantt\" data-source=\"gantt&#10;    title Chrome 发布节奏(简化)&#10;    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD&#10;    axisFormat %m/%d&#10;    section 版本 N&#10;    Canary/Dev     :a1, 2026-06-01, 7d&#10;    Beta           :a2, after a1, 14d&#10;    Stable         :a3, after a2, 7d&#10;    section 版本 N+1&#10;    Canary/Dev     :b1, 2026-06-15, 7d&#10;    Beta           :b2, after b1, 14d&#10;    Stable         :b3, after b2, 7d&#10;    section 版本 N+2&#10;    Canary/Dev     :c1, 2026-06-29, 7d&#10;    Beta           :c2, after c1, 14d&#10;    Stable         :c3, after c2, 7d\">gantt\n    title Chrome 发布节奏(简化)\n    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD\n    axisFormat %m/%d\n    section 版本 N\n    Canary/Dev     :a1, 2026-06-01, 7d\n    Beta           :a2, after a1, 14d\n    Stable         :a3, after a2, 7d\n    section 版本 N+1\n    Canary/Dev     :b1, 2026-06-15, 7d\n    Beta           :b2, after b1, 14d\n    Stable         :b3, after b2, 7d\n    section 版本 N+2\n    Canary/Dev     :c1, 2026-06-29, 7d\n    Beta           :c2, after c1, 14d\n    Stable         :c3, after c2, 7d</pre><p>版本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 进入 Stable 时，版本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 正在 Beta 阶段，版本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N+2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 已在 Canary 开发——形成流水线效应。</p>\n<h2 id=\"program-increment-与-safe-art\">Program Increment 与 SAFe ART</h2><p>在规模化敏捷框架（SAFe）中，Agile Release Train（ART）是跨团队协作的基本组织单元。一个 ART 内 5-12 个团队按统一节奏（通常 8-12 周的 Program Increment）交付集成的解决方案。</p>\n<p>PI 的内部结构：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时间段</th>\n<th>活动</th>\n<th>产出</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PI Planning（2天）</td>\n<td>跨团队对齐目标和依赖</td>\n<td>PI Objectives、Program Board</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迭代 1-4（各2周）</td>\n<td>开发、集成、测试</td>\n<td>可工作的增量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IP 迭代（1周）</td>\n<td>创新、技术债、发布准备</td>\n<td>发布候选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Inspect &amp; Adapt</td>\n<td>回顾和改进</td>\n<td>改进行动项</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Release Train Engineer（RTE）负责协调整个 ART 的节奏，确保：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>跨团队依赖在 PI Planning 中可视化</li>\n<li>System Demo 每两周展示集成进展</li>\n<li>阻塞项在 Scrum of Scrums 中及时升级</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"feature-freeze-与-code-freeze\">Feature Freeze 与 Code Freeze</h2><p>火车模型中的关键时间点：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 开发期&#10;        A[功能开发] --&gt; B[Feature Freeze]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 稳定期&#10;        B --&gt; C[只接受 Bug Fix]&#10;        C --&gt; D[Code Freeze]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 发布期&#10;        D --&gt; E[RC 构建]&#10;        E --&gt; F[验收测试]&#10;        F --&gt; G[GA 发布]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 开发期\n        A[功能开发] --&gt; B[Feature Freeze]\n    end\n    subgraph 稳定期\n        B --&gt; C[只接受 Bug Fix]\n        C --&gt; D[Code Freeze]\n    end\n    subgraph 发布期\n        D --&gt; E[RC 构建]\n        E --&gt; F[验收测试]\n        F --&gt; G[GA 发布]\n    end</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>Feature Freeze</strong>：截止日期后不再接受新功能合入 release 分支——未准备好的功能等下一班车</li>\n<li><strong>Code Freeze</strong>：冻结后只接受经审批的关键缺陷修复——确保 RC 稳定性</li>\n<li><strong>零缺陷出口标准</strong>：所有 P0/P1 缺陷已修复或有明确的 workaround</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"节奏与自动化的关系\">节奏与自动化的关系</h2><p>固定节奏使自动化投资回报最大化——因为发布流程高度可预测且重复执行：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>自动化项</th>\n<th>触发时机</th>\n<th>收益</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分支创建</td>\n<td>Feature Freeze 日</td>\n<td>消除人工分支管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RC 构建</td>\n<td>Code Freeze 后每日</td>\n<td>持续验证稳定性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回归测试套件</td>\n<td>RC 构建后自动</td>\n<td>早发现 regression</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发布说明生成</td>\n<td>GA 日</td>\n<td>消除手动编写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本号 bump</td>\n<td>GA 日</td>\n<td>消除人工决策</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>节奏越固定，各时间点的自动化触发条件就越清晰——这比&quot;某人决定现在该发布了&quot;的即兴模式可靠得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"应对节奏压力的机制\">应对节奏压力的机制</h2><p>火车模型面临的最大挑战是<strong>范围压力</strong>——团队倾向于在 Feature Freeze 前仓促合入未成熟的功能。应对机制：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>特性开关</strong>：功能代码合入 main 但在运行时关闭，不影响发布质量</li>\n<li><strong>质量门</strong>：合入 release 分支的 PR 必须通过额外的集成测试套件</li>\n<li><strong>Release Readiness Review</strong>：Feature Freeze 前的跨团队审查会议</li>\n<li><strong>火车延迟惩罚</strong>：如果火车因质量问题延迟，全团队承担后果——形成集体责任</li>\n</ol>\n<p>当火车模型与<a href=\"artifact-promotion-pipeline\">制品晋升管道</a>结合时，每个阶段的质量门自动执行，减少了依赖人工纪律来维持节奏的负担。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从周期发布到持续部署的演进路径\">从周期发布到持续部署的演进路径</h2><p>许多组织从月度发布火车开始，逐步缩短节奏直至实现持续部署：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>月度</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>自动化测试</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>双周</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>特性开关</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>周级</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>渐进式发布</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>持续</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{月度} \\xrightarrow{\\text{自动化测试}} \\text{双周} \\xrightarrow{\\text{特性开关}} \\text{周级} \\xrightarrow{\\text{渐进式发布}} \\text{持续}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">月度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">自动化测试</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">双周</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">特性开关</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">周级</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">渐进式发布</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">持续</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每次缩短节奏的前提是上一阶段的自动化和信心已经充分建立。跳跃式地从月度直接切换到持续部署，通常以灾难告终——因为中间的安全网（测试、开关、灰度）还没有就位。<a href=\"hotfix-emergency-release\">热修复与紧急发布</a>讨论的正是火车间隔之外的例外处理机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>发布火车的核心纪律是&quot;按时发车，不等功能&quot;——范围可变，时间不可变</li>\n<li>节奏选择取决于测试周期、合规审批时间、消费者吸收能力和团队规模</li>\n<li>Feature Freeze 和 Code Freeze 是火车模型中保障稳定性的关键时间点</li>\n<li>SAFe ART 通过 8-12 周的 Program Increment 协调多团队交付</li>\n<li>固定节奏使自动化投资回报最大化——触发条件清晰且可预测</li>\n<li>从周期发布到持续部署应渐进演进，每次缩短节奏前建立对应的安全网</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"发布火车与节奏","id":"发布火车与节奏"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"火车隐喻的工程含义","id":"火车隐喻的工程含义"},{"level":2,"text":"节奏设计的维度","id":"节奏设计的维度"},{"level":3,"text":"Chrome/Firefox 的四周节奏","id":"chrome-firefox-的四周节奏"},{"level":2,"text":"Program Increment 与 SAFe ART","id":"program-increment-与-safe-art"},{"level":2,"text":"Feature Freeze 与 Code Freeze","id":"feature-freeze-与-code-freeze"},{"level":2,"text":"节奏与自动化的关系","id":"节奏与自动化的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"应对节奏压力的机制","id":"应对节奏压力的机制"},{"level":2,"text":"从周期发布到持续部署的演进路径","id":"从周期发布到持续部署的演进路径"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"变更日志与发布说明","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/versioning-strategy/changelog-release-notes"},"next":{"title":"制品晋升管道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/release-process/artifact-promotion-pipeline"}}